In terms of performance, our platform indicates that common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95 latency. We also guarantee high availability, including outside office hours (24/7 services), with an availability target of 99.9%. Our solution will integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) using standard connectors and custom adapters. We support health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our API design and health interoperability capabilities.

